# Cross-origin isolation.
#
# With these two headers the page gets SharedArrayBuffer, which lets onnxruntime-web run
# multi-threaded WASM. Measured on an M-series Mac: threaded WASM starts in under a second
# and generates at ~27 tok/s, while the single-threaded fallback needs minutes just to build
# the session. See DECISIONS.md.
#
# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file. GitHub Pages serves static files only and
# ignores it, which is why the deployed build leans on WebGPU - see README, "Hosting".
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
